sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as index.html
  participant API as POST /predict
  participant FM as FrozenModels
  participant TF as TF-IDF + LR
  participant B as BERT
  User->>UI: Enter non-blank text and analyze
  UI->>API: {"text": "..."}
  API->>FM: validate and access loaded artifacts
  par Independent TF-IDF path
    FM->>TF: transform, predict, predict_proba
    TF-->>FM: class and probability map
  and Independent BERT path
    FM->>B: tokenize, inference_mode, softmax
    B-->>FM: class and probability map
  end
  FM-->>API: tfidf and bert result objects
  API-->>UI: 200 JSON response
  UI-->>User: classes, confidences, agreement
